Sentinel-1 SAFE fixture
=======================

The manifest.safe and annotation XML files under
S1B_IW_SLC__1SDV_20210401T052622_20210401T052650_026269_032297_EFA4.SAFE
come from the Apache-2.0 test data of bopen/xarray-sentinel:

  https://github.com/bopen/xarray-sentinel
  tests/data/S1B_IW_SLC__1SDV_20210401T052622_20210401T052650_026269_032297_EFA4.zip

Copyright B-Open Solutions and the xarray-sentinel contributors.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy is in
LICENSE.Apache-2.0 in this directory.

The underlying Sentinel-1 scene is Copernicus data from ESA. This tree is
the reduced snapshot published with xarray-sentinel, not a full SLC product.

Modifications in this repository
--------------------------------
- annotation/calibration/* and support/*.xsd are omitted. Product open does
  not read schemas, calibration sidecars, or the product PDF.
- measurement/*.tiff are replaced with small uncompressed complex64 rasters.
  The upstream files are zstd-compressed placeholders (TIFF compression
  50000) and are not readable with tifffile alone.
- preview/quick-look.png was added here. That snapshot did not include
  preview/.

S1B_IW_SLC__1SDV_20210401T052622_20210401T052650_026269_032297_EFA4.zip is a
ZIP_STORED archive of the same tree, so a measurement TIFF can be read by
file offset without extracting the zip.
